        "example": "An enterprise's taxable income expands from $111.8M to $121.8M under Section 115BAA due to forfeiting $10M in additional depreciation. At 25.168%, Section 115BAA tax is $30.65M. In the Old Regime, after burning $15M in MAT credit, cash tax was $24.07M. In Year 1, the Old Regime saves $6.59M in cash tax, proving that opting for Section 115BAA prematurely would destroy capital.",
        "code": "import json\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Dict\n\n@dataclass\nclass Section115BAAAssessmentData:\n    book_profit_before_tax: float\n    taxable_income_normal_regime: float\n    special_deductions_forfeited_under_baa: float # e.g. Addl Depr, SEZ\n    sec80jjaa_employment_deduction_retained: float\n    accumulated_mat_credit_on_balance_sheet: float\n    old_regime_cash_tax_payable: float\n\nclass Section115BAAEvaluator:\n    @staticmethod\n    def assess_concessional_regime(data: Section115BAAAssessmentData) -> Dict:\n        # Taxable base expands under Sec 115BAA by adding back forfeited deductions\n        taxable_base_baa = data.taxable_income_normal_regime + data.special_deductions_forfeited_under_baa\n        \n        # Tax at flat effective 25.168%\n        tax_liability_baa = taxable_base_baa * 0.25168\n        \n        # Annual tax savings compared to Old Regime cash tax\n        annual_variance = data.old_regime_cash_tax_payable - tax_liability_baa\n        \n        # Asset write-off of MAT credit\n        mat_credit_lost = data.accumulated_mat_credit_on_balance_sheet\n        \n        return {\n            'taxable_income_old_regime': data.taxable_income_normal_regime,\n            'deductions_forfeited_under_sec115baa': data.special_deductions_forfeited_under_baa,\n            'recalibrated_taxable_base_sec115baa': round(taxable_base_baa, 2),\n            'effective_tax_rate_sec115baa': 25.168,\n            'total_tax_payable_sec115baa': round(tax_liability_baa, 2),\n            'old_regime_cash_tax_benchmark': round(data.old_regime_cash_tax_payable, 2),\n            'immediate_annual_cash_tax_saving': round(annual_variance, 2),\n            'forfeited_mat_credit_asset_writeoff': round(mat_credit_lost, 2),\n            'complete_mat_immunity_sec115jb_5a': True\n        }\n\nbaa_input = Section115BAAAssessmentData(\n    book_profit_before_tax=120000000.0,\n    taxable_income_normal_regime=111800000.0,\n    special_deductions_forfeited_under_baa=10000000.0, # 10M Additional Depr forfeited\n    sec80jjaa_employment_deduction_retained=6000000.0,\n    accumulated_mat_credit_on_balance_sheet=15000000.0,\n    old_regime_cash_tax_payable=24067392.0 # From Part 3 (after MAT credit absorption)\n)\nengine = Section115BAAEvaluator()\nres = engine.assess_concessional_regime(baa_input)\nprint(json.dumps(res, indent=2))\n",
