          "Welcome to the Grand Master Capstone Viva Gate of Milestone Project 3. In this culminating module, we integrate all four analytical pipelines—Comprehensive PGBP Income (Part 1), Certified Book Profit under Section 115JB (Part 2), Dual-Track Tax Confrontation & MAT Credit Mechanics (Part 3), and Section 115BAA Concessional Assessment (Part 4)—into an executive Multi-Year Decision Cockpit.",
