      "Part 4 (Cross-Border Withholding, DTAA & Form 15CA/CB Execution Engine): Section 90(4) and Section 90(5) strictly condition treaty access on obtaining a valid Tax Residency Certificate (TRC) and Form 10F from the foreign payee.",
