      "Part 1 (First Appellate Stage: Appeal before CIT(Appeals) under Section 246A & 250): Section 251(2) explicitly mandates that the CIT(Appeals) shall not enhance an assessment or a penalty unless the appellant has had a reasonable opportunity of showing cause against such enhancement.",
