        "output": "Indirect Tax Monthly Waterfall (Rule 88A Execution):\n  Gross Outward Output Tax : INR 18.00 Cr\n  GSTR-2B Verified Credit  : INR 14.00 Cr\n  Quarantined Unmatched ITC: INR 1.00 Cr (Sec 16(2)(aa))\n  Net Utilized ITC         : INR 12.50 Cr\n  Net Cash Challan (PMT-06): INR 5.50 Cr\n  Closing Credit Ledger    : INR 0.00 Cr",
