        "tryIt": "In the code editor, change advance_base (currently 186500.0) and pricing_rate_pct (currently 20.0) in the evaluate_advance() call, for example set the rate to 0.0 or 100.0, then run the snippet and verify how the adjustment, net position and coverage ratio respond.",
