          "Your second capstone challenge tackles the core engine of multinational commerce: Multi-Jurisdictional Supply Chain Transfer Pricing and Intellectual Property (IP) Licensing Defense. Your conglomerate operates an advanced contract manufacturing plant in Pune, an enterprise software and digital R&D center in Bengaluru, an IP holding and brand management hub in Singapore, and consumer sales distribution subsidiaries across Europe and North America. You must configure intercompany transaction flows to reflect the true economic distribution of Functions, Assets, and Risks (FAR), ensuring full compliance with Section 92C and OECD Guidelines.",
