    "recap": "In Day 35 (🏆 Milestone 7 Capstone: Cross-Border Tax Architecture & Controversy Defense Simulation), you mastered foundational workflows and verified deterministic execution outputs. Today in Day 36 (Advanced GST Input Tax Credit: Rule 42 & 43 Apportionment, Banking & Capital Goods Reversals), we build directly on that foundation by mastering Statutory Architecture of Input Tax Credit & Dual-Use Apportionment under Section 17 and Rule 42 Mathematical Mechanics: Inputs & Input Services Apportionment Formulas.",
